{
  "about": "What the share sheet can hand over, and the one right reading of it. The rows of section 2.5 of the plan, held against the Swift parser here and meant for the unit's parser too. `redirects` stands in for the single no-redirect request, `placeIDs` for MKMapItemRequest and `searches` for MKLocalSearch: a parser for the unit may skip the rows it has no way to answer (mapItem, placeIDs).",
